<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling stable on dollar at 590.3766.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling stable on dollar at 590.3766.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling remained virtually unchanged against the dollar on Friday, at a commercial rate of 590.3766 compared to 590.3370 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Commercial dealers said against the pound, the shilling was posted at a mean of 925.1231 versus 925.6496 on Thursday.</p>
